      "point_id": "java.lang.exception",
      "level": 1,
      "type": "concept",
      "prompt": "IOException 属于受检异常还是非受检异常？",
      "answer": "受检异常",
      "accept": [
        "checked",
        "checked exception",
        "受检",
        "检查型异常"
      ],
      "explain": "受检异常必须 try-catch 或 throws 声明。RuntimeException 及其子类是非受检异常。",
      "tags": [
        "面试"
